{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-47","kind":"proposition","title":"勾股定理：直角三角形斜边平方等于两直角边平方和","englishTitle":"In right-angled triangles the square on the side subtending the right angle is equal to the squares on the sides containing the right angle.","book":1,"number":47,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.47","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.47/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":47,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","contentId":"euclid-1-47","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4624cd0fa52f38ef10c60ab96253b0e4f769bed6bb7c6cf2422c5a0111845b74","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-47.statement","euclid-1-47.construction.1","euclid-1-47.proof.1","euclid-1-47.construction.2","euclid-1-47.proof.2","euclid-1-47.proof.3","euclid-1-47.proof.4","euclid-1-47.proof.5","euclid-1-47.proof.6","euclid-1-47.proof.7","euclid-1-47.proof.8","euclid-1-47.proof.9","euclid-1-47.proof.10","euclid-1-47.proof.11","euclid-1-47.proof.12","euclid-1-47.conclusion","euclid-1-47.historical.1","euclid-1-47.historical.2","euclid-1-47.historical.3","euclid-1-47.historical.4","euclid-1-47.historical.5","euclid-1-47.historical.6","euclid-1-47.historical.7","euclid-1-47.historical.8","euclid-1-47.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-47.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8beec7d4361da337608273b6100ba34623a70bad4f69745fb36260f3b1e34a8b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In right-angled triangles the square on the side subtending the right angle is equal to the squares on the sides containing the right angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在直角三角形中，斜边上所作正方形的面积等于两条直角边上所作正方形的面积之和。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三边直角形对直角边上所作直角方形与馀两边上所作两直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在直角三角形中，斜边上所作正方形的面积等于两条直角边上所作正方形的面积之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e419819c31a104a99aaeaed9ac1cf0841dc39d754bf71c21fae7f10be314f15","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a right-angled triangle having the angle BAC right;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设 ABC 为直角三角形，其中角 BAC 是直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38bb66b3d5874c735c7de025a234e245d3e5afb64f06a6155ea680e872926385","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the square on BC is equal to the squares on BA, AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要证明：以斜边 BC 为边所作正方形的面积，等于分别以直角边 BA、AC 为边所作两个正方形的面积之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8bd88d06c509b6cf91245750d39f4a7f782b06a5d19a9a926c075539520ce001","citations":["euclid-1-46"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let there be described on BC the square BDEC, and on BA, AC the squares GB, HC; [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)] through A let AL be drawn parallel to either BD or CE, and let AD, FC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"分别以 BC、BA、AC 为边作正方形 BDEC、GB、HC [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)]；过点 A 作 AL，令它平行于 BD 或 CE，并连接 AD、FC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7bb4a2bb9609c4e520e7044df75ebe4ab0918557c035e9da77d2a82194ba86bd","citations":["euclid-1-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since each of the angles BAC, BAG is right, it follows that with a straight line BA, and at the point A on it, the two straight lines AC, AG not lying on the same side make the adjacent angles equal to two right angles; therefore CA is in a straight line with AG. [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为角 BAC 与角 BAG 都是直角，所以在直线 BA 上的点 A 处，不在同侧的直线 AC、AG 形成的相邻两角之和等于两个直角；因此 CA 与 AG 在同一条直线上 [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c25185e03c249ed18e97034b445a13fda84cf0c7407aa32d0bc23cf52599d600","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason BA is also in a straight line with AH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同理，BA 与 AH 也在同一条直线上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99b4cc75ff19fdbf0bb10e9fbcb71aab7761d2e4abe25422a3920f957137b045","citations":["euclid-1-cn-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle DBC is equal to the angle FBA: for each is right: let the angle ABC be added to each; therefore the whole angle DBA is equal to the whole angle FBC. [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为角 DBC 与角 FBA 都是直角，所以它们相等；在两角上分别加上角 ABC，可得整个角 DBA 等于整个角 FBC [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"247d2a4296c14e361f7209be0e99ea22ea418532ce46712a9b31983cef4d4fb8","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DB is equal to BC, and FB to BA, the two sides AB, BD are equal to the two sides FB, BC respectively, and the angle ABD is equal to the angle FBC; therefore the base AD is equal to the base FC, and the triangle ABD is equal to the triangle FBC. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"又因为 DB 等于 BC，FB 等于 BA，所以 AB、BD 两边分别等于 FB、BC 两边；并且角 ABD 等于角 FBC。因此底边 AD 等于底边 FC，三角形 ABD 与三角形 FBC 全等 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b799f36ff3c067c46f61bfebd272fffa6d180bfb803a01460dc6c7dd35fba2c","citations":["euclid-1-41"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the parallelogram BL is double of the triangle ABD, for they have the same base BD and are in the same parallels BD, AL. [[I. 41](/principles/euclid-1-41)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平行四边形 BL 的面积是三角形 ABD 面积的两倍，因为它们以 BD 为同一底边，并位于平行线 BD、AL 之间 [[I. 41](/principles/euclid-1-41)]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a9868466cb64158390a04a35ff02f0af110cada3de89918cfc75d34e9932110","citations":["euclid-1-41"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square GB is double of the triangle FBC, for they again have the same base FB and are in the same parallels FB, GC. [[I. 41](/principles/euclid-1-41)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同理，正方形 GB 的面积是三角形 FBC 面积的两倍，因为它们以 FB 为同一底边，并位于平行线 FB、GC 之间 [[I. 41](/principles/euclid-1-41)]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f79d1c062e6f31e8bc66be3cdaeaf6af0551c5cfb6321212b564b007ab27efba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[But the doubles of equals are equal to one another.] Therefore the parallelogram BL is also equal to the square GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"相等面积的两倍仍然相等，因此平行四边形 BL 的面积等于正方形 GB 的面积。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"864351131d6dcccb3b831adbe4c16e151a074fc27a5c63591b08d9d6cf4c59ed","citations":["euclid-1-cn-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly, if AE, BK be joined, the parallelogram CL can also be proved equal to the square HC; therefore the whole square BDEC is equal to the two squares GB, HC. [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同理，连接 AE、BK，可以证明平行四边形 CL 的面积等于正方形 HC 的面积；因此整个正方形 BDEC 的面积等于正方形 GB 与 HC 的面积之和 [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2f1f6a6a94c397b0bc8414a196e74317fca7246bae0cdc569a39356ddd4401d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square BDEC is described on BC, and the squares GB, HC on BA, AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其中，正方形 BDEC 作在 BC 上，正方形 GB、HC 分别作在 BA、AC 上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7267ebe5b3ac09623be64baba2b08413a48ff7364abe32557745b80a910ae5d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on the side BC is equal to the squares on the sides BA, AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以，斜边 BC 上所作正方形的面积等于两条直角边 BA、AC 上所作正方形的面积之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b07ac5e2c2df05848524e08084d206335ac72d71705c2fd8c9f4c998028d9ab9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三边直角形对直角边上所作直角方形与馀两边上所作两直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在直角三角形中，斜边上所作正方形的面积等于两条直角边上所作正方形的面积之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3c255c4370677a29665af439a95f15878974182d25cc9fe4dbbb595fb13c04f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙角形于对乙甲丙直角之乙丙边上作乙丙丁戊直角方形〈本篇四六〉题言此形与甲乙边上所作甲乙己庚及甲丙边上所作甲丙辛壬两直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设甲乙丙为直角三角形，角乙甲丙为直角。在其对边乙丙上作正方形乙丙丁戊〈本篇四六〉。命题要证明：这个正方形的面积等于分别以甲乙、甲丙为边所作正方形甲乙己庚、甲丙辛壬的面积之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d958d43d5e3d8564b781f5770f08d610fbb95b6fe8e128fab1b93184719b71fc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试从甲作甲癸直线与乙戊丙丁平行〈本篇卅一〉分乙丙边于子次自甲至丁至戊各作直线末自乙至辛自丙至己各作直线其乙甲丙与乙甲庚既皆直角即庚甲甲丙是一直线〈本篇十四〉依显乙甲甲壬亦一直线又丙乙戊与甲乙己既皆直角而每加一甲乙丙角即甲乙戊与丙乙己两角亦等〈公论二〉依显甲丙丁与乙丙辛两角亦等又甲乙戊角形之甲乙乙戊两边与丙乙己角形之己乙乙丙两边等甲乙戊与丙乙己两角复等则对等角之甲戊与丙己两边亦等而此两角形亦等矣〈本篇四〉夫甲乙己庚直角方形倍大于同乙己底同在平行线内之丙乙己角形〈本篇四一〉而乙戊癸子直角形亦倍大于同乙戊底同在平行线内之甲乙戊角形则甲乙己庚不与乙戊癸子等乎〈公论〉〈六〉依显甲丙辛壬直角方形与丙丁癸子直角形等则乙戊丁丙一形与甲乙己庚甲丙辛壬两形并等矣一増凡直角方形之对角线上作直角方形倍大于元形如甲乙丙丁直角方形之甲丙线上作直角方形倍大于甲乙丙丁形二増题设不等两直角方形如一以甲为边一以乙为边求别作两直角方形自相等而并之又与元设两形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：过甲作直线甲癸，使它与乙戊及丙丁平行〈本篇卅一〉，并与乙丙交于子；再连接相关顶点。由于角乙甲丙与角乙甲庚都是直角，所以庚、甲、丙在同一直线上〈本篇十四〉；同理，乙、甲、壬也共线。在两个相等的直角上加同一个角，可以得到角甲乙戊等于角丙乙己〈公论二〉；同理还有对应角相等。因此，三角形甲乙戊与三角形丙乙己的两边及夹角分别相等，两个三角形全等〈本篇四〉。正方形甲乙己庚的面积是同底同高三角形丙乙己面积的两倍〈本篇四一〉；矩形乙戊癸子的面积也是全等三角形甲乙戊面积的两倍，所以这两块面积相等〈公论〉〈六〉。同理，正方形甲丙辛壬的面积等于矩形丙丁癸子的面积。将两部分相加，可得斜边上的正方形乙戊丁丙的面积，等于两个直角边上正方形甲乙己庚、甲丙辛壬的面积之和。古译随后补充：以正方形对角线为边所作正方形的面积是原正方形面积的两倍；并提出把两个不相等的正方形改作两个彼此相等、总面积不变的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":19,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4d9928498963a450806595f6d7f41d5f1b9169d28d2da18a5231b5121f95c5f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：先作丙戊线与甲等次作戊丙丁直角而丙丁线与乙等次作戊丁线相聨末于丙丁戊角丙戊丁角各作一角皆半于直角己戊己丁两腰遇于己〈公论十一〉而等〈本篇六〉即己戊己丁两线上所作两直角方形自相等而并之又与丙戊丙丁上所作两直角方形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作法：先作线段丙戊等于甲，并在丙处作直角，使丙丁等于乙；连接戊丁。再分别在角丙丁戊与角丙戊丁处作与直角一半相等的角，使两条线段己戊、己丁交于己〈公论十一〉。于是己戊等于己丁〈本篇六〉；分别以它们为边所作的两个正方形面积相等，而其面积之和又等于以丙戊、丙丁为边所作两个原正方形的面积之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":20,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f0bc6407e20e496431a3ea04433a5ecec009e84fb76e7a038faf98fd40b64d1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：己丁戊己戊丁两角既皆半于直角则丁己戊为直角〈本篇卅二〉而对直角之丁戊线上所作直角方形与两腰线上所作两直角方形并等矣〈本题〉己戊与己丁既等则其上所作两直角方形自相等矣又丁戊线上所作直角方形与丙丁丙戊线上所作两直角方形并既等则己戊己丁上两直角方形并与丙戊丙丁上两直角方形并亦等三増题多直角方形求并作一直角方形与之等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：角己丁戊与角己戊丁都等于半个直角，所以角丁己戊是直角〈本篇卅二〉。根据本命题，斜边丁戊上所作正方形的面积等于两条直角边上正方形的面积之和〈本题〉。又因为己戊等于己丁，这两条边上所作正方形面积彼此相等。而丁戊上所作正方形又等于丙丁、丙戊上两个正方形的面积之和，因此新作两个正方形的面积之和与原来两个正方形的面积之和相等。古译进一步提出：给定多个正方形，作一个面积等于它们总面积的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":21,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4851eac32cc9b9c0ec728c85532f616f49fcdc0e141bb7d6e46c8b74fafd1fe9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：如五直角方形以甲乙丙丁戊为边任等不等求作一直角方形与五形并等先作己庚辛直角而己庚线与甲等庚辛线与乙等次作己辛线旋作己辛壬直角而辛壬与丙等次作己壬线旋作己壬癸直角而壬癸与丁等次作己癸线旋作己癸子直角而癸子与戊等末作己子线题言己子线上所作直角方形即所求"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作法：设五个正方形的边长分别为甲、乙、丙、丁、戊，可以相等也可以不同。先作以甲、乙为直角边的直角三角形，得到斜边己辛；再以己辛、丙为直角边作直角三角形，依次加入丁和戊，最终得到线段己子。以己子为边所作正方形的面积，正好等于这五个原正方形的面积之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.historical.7","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":22,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96b4b192c3320876e2f8db3acda0a9b364455a6608b2030a1153be2ee1fec787","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：己辛上作直角方形与甲乙两形并等〈本题〉己壬上作直角方形与己辛及丙两形并等馀仿此推显可至无穷四増三边直角形以两边求第三边长短之数"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：根据本命题，以己辛为边的正方形面积等于以甲、乙为边的两个正方形面积之和〈本题〉；继续加入边长丙、丁、戊时，每一步都应用同样的结论，因此可以推广到任意多个正方形。古译接着讨论：已知直角三角形两条边的长度，怎样求第三边的长度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.historical.8","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":23,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"04bb000b5791614d8b034147efdfb39366db8a973f1da53005e7a8ec9e564a5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙丙角形甲为直角先得甲乙甲丙两边长短之数如甲乙六甲丙八求乙丙边长短之数其甲乙甲丙上所作两直角方形并既与乙丙上所作直角方形等〈本题〉则甲乙之羃〈自乘之数曰：羃〉得三十六甲丙之羃得六十四并之得百而乙丙之羃亦百百开方得十即乙丙数十也又设先得甲乙乙丙如甲乙六乙丙十而求甲丙之数其甲乙甲丙上两直角方形并既与乙丙上直角方形等则甲乙之羃得三十六乙丙之羃得百百减三十六得甲丙之羃六十四六十四开方得八即甲丙八也求甲乙仿此此以开方尽实者为例其不尽实者自具算家分法"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"例如，直角三角形甲乙丙在甲处为直角。若甲乙等于 6、甲丙等于 8，则斜边乙丙的平方等于两个直角边平方之和〈本题〉：6²＋8²＝36＋64＝100，所以乙丙等于 √100＝10。反过来，若已知甲乙等于 6、斜边乙丙等于 10，则另一条直角边甲丙的平方等于 10²－6²＝100－36＝64，因此甲丙等于 √64＝8。其他边也可以同样求得；这里举的是能够恰好开平方的整数例子，不能整开时还需使用相应的计算方法。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-47.source","contentId":"euclid-1-47","revisionId":"euclid-1-47@raw-4624cd0fa52f38ef","order":24,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1a14c2af54ce0debb945cba420528781db284a7c6923a58455f1b08e0dbffc2","citations":[]